{
  "id": "p24",
  "title": "A Summer in the Valley",
  "titleZh": "山谷里的夏天",
  "topic": "野外考察",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our aim is to study the valley through a summer program.",
        "zh": "我们的目标是通过一个夏季项目研究这条山谷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The team recruits anyone willing to walk, watch, and work.",
        "zh": "团队招募任何愿意走路、观察和干活的人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, throughout the route, we mark each plant and stone.",
        "zh": "然后，沿整条路线，我们标记每一株植物和每一块石头。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quiet guide will accompany us alongside the cold mountain stream.",
        "zh": "一位安静的向导会陪我们沿着冰冷的山间小溪走。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each type of landscape needs a different and careful method.",
        "zh": "每种地形都需要不同的、细致的调查方法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We seek small signs and concentrate on every slow change.",
        "zh": "我们寻找细小的迹象，专注于每一个缓慢的变化。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The quantity of acid in the wet soil looks quite high.",
        "zh": "湿土里的酸含量看起来相当高。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Old stone pipes drain the surplus water into the lake.",
        "zh": "旧石管把多余的水排进湖里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My sister says fresh food brings vitamin C for strong muscles.",
        "zh": "我姐姐说新鲜食物能带来维生素C，让肌肉强健。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We combat rough weather with warm coats and strong boots.",
        "zh": "我们用暖和的外套和结实的靴子对抗恶劣天气。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Our short journal must demonstrate results, not necessarily speed.",
        "zh": "我们简短的日志必须展示结果，不一定要展示速度。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A local politician claims the little town needs more funds.",
        "zh": "一位本地政客声称这个小镇需要更多资金。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The county is responsible for this narrow, broken village road.",
        "zh": "县里负责这条狭窄破损的村路。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our teacher is worried about our small but growing reputation.",
        "zh": "我们的老师为我们小而渐长的名声感到担心。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My teacher's kind remark gives me comfort after a long day.",
        "zh": "老师善意的一句话让我在漫长一天后感到安慰。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We confront hard facts with real sympathy, not quick anger.",
        "zh": "我们以真正的同情而不是怒气面对严酷的事实。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We never condemn an innocent helper for one honest mistake.",
        "zh": "我们从不因一个诚实的错误责备无辜的帮手。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sudden twist in the path prompts a short rest.",
        "zh": "小路上突然的转折让人短暂休息一下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quiet observer peers at the birds from a rock.",
        "zh": "一位安静的观察者从岩石上盯着那些鸟。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My recording of bird song helps our small craft improve.",
        "zh": "我录下的鸟鸣帮助我们这门小手艺进步。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A new version of the map appears within a week.",
        "zh": "地图的新版本一周之内就会出来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later we found that every user wants simple, clear notes.",
        "zh": "后来我们发现每个使用者都想要简单清楚的说明。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They advertise the winning photo in a small corner shop.",
        "zh": "他们在一家街角小店展出那张获奖照片。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A painting of the green hills shows a bird in flight.",
        "zh": "一幅青山画上有一只鸟在飞翔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The loss of old trees shows a clear lack of spring rain.",
        "zh": "老树的消失明显说明春天下雨太少。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Unity and a good combination of skills bring steady results.",
        "zh": "团结加上良好的技能组合能带来稳定的成果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we proceed slowly and specialize in quiet, careful field work.",
        "zh": "然后我们慢慢推进，专门做安静细致的野外工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A health class is supposed to discuss abortion with care.",
        "zh": "一堂健康课应该谨慎地讨论堕胎问题。"
      }
    ]
  ],
